WEBVTT

00:04:58.586 --> 00:05:00.463
of what would be my first board game.

00:05:00.838 --> 00:05:03.424
I also generated
a number of trivia questions

00:05:03.466 --> 00:05:07.136
and then called up my former primary
school teacher in Kyangwali refugee camp.

00:05:07.178 --> 00:05:10.556
And I asked if I could visit
my primary school once again.

00:05:10.598 --> 00:05:12.183
He was generous, and he said yes.

00:05:12.725 --> 00:05:15.019
When I showed up at my former
primary school,

00:05:15.061 --> 00:05:16.854
the kids were excited,

00:05:16.896 --> 00:05:18.898
and most of them
jumped out of their seats

00:05:18.939 --> 00:05:21.901
when I told them what I held
in my hands was a board game.

00:05:22.234 --> 00:05:25.529
Surprisingly, none of them actually
knew even how the game was played.

00:05:25.571 --> 00:05:28.282
But heading towards the board game,
they were thrilled.

00:05:28.991 --> 00:05:31.660
Working with the teachers
and the school administration,